<title>GERMANY: Commerzbank to open office in Taiwan.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank to open office in Taiwan.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Commerzbank AG said on Monday that it was opening a representative office in Taiwan.</p>
<p>The Frankfurt-based bank said the new office, which will be formally opened on Tuesday, will be the 28th foreign office it has in operation.</p>
<p>Commerzbank said the growing trade between Asia and Germany was the main factor for the new office. The bank said trade between Taiwan and Germany in 1995 rose 19 percent to $9.5 billion.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
